@ Additional entry points; the original selector owns gates and saved progress.
TrioEchoCatchup_Guide::
	lockall
	faceplayer
	msgbox TrioEchoCatchup_Text, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
	goto TrioRift_Entrance

TrioEchoCatchup_Text:
	.string "Did you hear the girls'\nechoes after the picnic?\pThree trials still wait:\nEcho Woods, Mirror House,\pand Lantern Trail. You\ncan visit them any time.\pI can guide you onward,\nor revisit earlier trials.\pEach guardian is ten\nlevels above your best.\pBring all three girls.\nThey face it together!\pTrial exits lead back to\nGoldenrod's Center.$"
